// ATLAS — fly around the solar system and find out what is on it.
//
//   milo build examples/games/atlas/main.milo -o /tmp/atlas --release && /tmp/atlas
//
// Drag to spin the world, scroll to fly in and out, and click a glowing dot to
// learn what is there. `L` swaps between two reading levels, because the same
// place needs different words at five and at twelve.
//
// The whole scene is ten draw calls: a sky, a ball, a ring, a halo, a bloom
// chain, and one batched vertex buffer for the entire interface.

